{"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Status"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:appearance:shape:size:hasLoader:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(label:status:appearance:shape:size:hasLoader:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(loadingKey:tableName:bundle:shape:size:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(loadingLabel:shape:size:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Appearance","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Shape","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/Size"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTag"}],"symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"tvOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"visionOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false},{"name":"watchOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents7OUDSTagV","title":"OUDSTag","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTag","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTag","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags have two appearances so as to highlight or not their content:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"emphasized"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with a solid, high-contrast background. Used to draw strong attention to important"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"labels or categories. Emphasized tags stand out prominently against the interface and are ideal for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"primary or high-priority information."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"muted"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with a subtle, light, or semi-transparent background. Used for secondary or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"less prominent information. Muted tags blend more with the background, providing a softer visual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emphasis compared to emphasized tags."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Status","text":"Status","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags have seven status depending on the context of the information they represent. Each state is designed"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to convey a specific meaning and ensure clarity in communication."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Default or inactive state. Used for standard labels, categories, or when no specific"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status needs to be communicated."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Used to draw attention to new features, recommendations, or content suggestions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Invites users to explore and engage with new offerings, creating an exciting and engaging experience.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Indicates success, confirmation, or a positive status. Commonly used to highlight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"completed actions or approved items.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Signals caution or a potentially risky situation. Used to draw attention to items","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requiring user awareness or intervention.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Represents errors, critical issues, or urgent attention needed. Used to highlight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"problems or failed actions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Conveys informational messages or supplementary details. Used for neutral, helpful,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"or contextual information."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Disabled"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Shows that the tag is inactive and cannot be interacted with. Appears faded or greyed out. This is not","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"allowed when loader is activated.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Shape","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Shape"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags can have two shapes:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rounded"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with fully rounded corners, creating a pill-shaped appearance. Rounded"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tags offer a softer and more approachable look, suitable for most modern interfaces."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Square","type":"text"}]},{"text":": A tag with sharp, square corners. Squared tags provide a more formal, structured, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"technical feel. They are often used in business contexts to label promotions, offers, or important notices.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Size","type":"heading","text":"Size"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags can have two sizes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The standard tag size, suitable for most use cases and offering good readability.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Small"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A compact tag with reduced height and font size. Used when saving space is important or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when grouping elements visually.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","text":"Layout"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are four available layouts for tags:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"-"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text only","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A tag that displays only text. Used for simple labels, categories, or keywords without additional visual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"-"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text + Bullet","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A tag with a small indicator (dot) alongside the text. Used to show status, presence, or activity"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next to the label."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"-"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text + Icon","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A tag that includes an icon before the text. Used to visually reinforce the meaning of the tag,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as status, type, or action."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text + Loader"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A tag that combines a loading spinner (or progress indicator) with text. Used to indicate that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a process or action related to the tag is in progress.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Text only with neutral status, for emphasized appearance with rounded shape in default size","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\",  status: .neutral(), appearance: .emphasized, shape: .rounded, size: .default)","    \/\/ Or also","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\")","    \/\/ Or from a localizale and a bundle","    OUDSTag(LocalizedStringKey(\"label_wording\"), bundle: Bundle.module)","","    \/\/ Tag with neutral status with bullet","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(leading: .bullet)","","    \/\/ Tag with neutral status with a custom decorative icon","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"))))","    \/\/ If your layout is in RTL mode but your tag has an icon with another meaning because of bad orientation,","    \/\/ you can flip the icon using OUDSImage.flipped","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), flipped: true)))","    \/\/ If you want to display a raw image (not tinted), use renderingMode: .original","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original)))","","    \/\/ Text with neutral status with bullet","    OUDSTag(label: \"Label\", status: .neutral(bullet: true))","","    \/\/ Tag with loader with rounded shape in small size","    OUDSTag(loadingLabel: \"Label\", shape: .rounded, size: .small)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-tag"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tag_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Version","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.5.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}]},{"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.18.0","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Tag is a UI element that allows to display short info like a label, keyword, or category.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Tag helps users quickly find, group, or understand content.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTag/init(loadingLabel:shape:size:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTag\/init(loadingLabel:shape:size:)","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstag\/init(loadinglabel:shape:size:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"init(loadingLabel:shape:size:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"te